## Whole-file declarations, data, registration and contextual obligations (unit-1)

Builds the static comparison image with three 100px grid rows in a 300px container. Its child spans three rows and uses row subgrid with a 150px gap. Two blue 100px squares occupy subgrid rows 2 and 3. The paired test uses display:grid-lanes on the outer container while retaining these child constraints, so changing reference track sizing, gap, placement or colors changes the visual expected result. There is no script, callback, event registration or mutable application state in this reference.


